<td><strong>Barrel Length</strong></td>
<td>4.5&#8243;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Overall Length</strong></td>
<td>8&#8243;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Weight</strong></td>
<td>23.9 oz</td>
